================================================================================
Attribution
================================================================================

If you build on Polaris — code, schema, architectural patterns
(audit-of-record discipline, constraint lattice),
or the post-v2 strategic moment framing — please retain the LICENSE +
NOTICE files and the author attribution per Apache 2.0 §4.

The audit-of-record discipline is the project's central methodological
contribution: state-changing decisions are recorded in the schema (nine
append-only trigger instances) and on the filesystem (CHANGELOG.md plus
git history). The same discipline applies at the license level:
provenance is preserved.
